      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My major concern that would prevent me from using this for my own events is how would it function with queueing for group instances? I would only use this if it still allowed for queueing but gave the staff in the instance the option to allow the next person in or not.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
