      "value": "@{646104a41e7ea0626d9b8c9d|full_name} Maybe we could combine it with a queue: where those who requested are in the queue and the staff member, who is responsible to let in people, sees the queue and accepts them accordingly. But with that we would also need a way to kick people from the queue with a response like \"Instance full, req in 20 mins\" or something similar.\n\nMaybe I am just overthinking this in a way but that still would be a great addition to my request.\n\nWhat do you think about that?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
