      "value": "@{646104a41e7ea0626d9b8c9d|full_name} Yeah, that was actually one of my original ideas that I had but from my point of view this would honestly take much longer to implement than my current proposal, as this is literally something VRChat can already do.\n\nStill, in the long run, having a way to change which roles can join and/or change how many can join while a group instance is open would be a killer feature and I want to see that too.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
